    "Every asset is generated with Higgsfield (GPT Image 2.5 keyframes, Seedance 2.5 clips) and post-processed with ffmpeg.",
    "Video slots list sources in preference order (AV1 WebM, VP9 WebM, H.264 MP4): put them inside <video autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=...> unless loop is false.",
    "Backgrounds are #03050f navy, so use mix-blend-mode: screen instead of an alpha channel.",
    "Under prefers-reduced-motion, show the poster for video and animated-image slots."
  ],
